{
  "@context": "https://schema.org/",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is Zoom Canvas?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "\u003Cp\u003EZoom Canvas \u0026mdash; formerly known as Zoom Docs \u0026mdash; is an AI-powered collaborative content and workspace tool that transforms team discussions and meetings into shareable documents, wikis, tables, and forms. It\u0027s designed to help teams collaborate more effectively before, during, and after meetings by automatically generating content blocks with drag-and-drop functionality.\u003C/p\u003E"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How is Zoom Canvas different from Zoom Paper?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "\u003Cp\u003EZoom Canvas and Zoom Paper are both AI-powered, collaborative document creation and productivity apps.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZoom Paper is designed for traditional document structure. It\u0027s a more formal word processor designed to bridge the gap between the old world of legacy docs and the new world of collaborative content creation. With Zoom Paper, you can build formatted documents in printable page layouts that you can also turn into templates for organization-wide use.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EZoom Canvas, meanwhile, is designed for collaboration across multiple digital content formats, from shared docs and wikis, to tables and forms. Zoom Canvas\u0027s strength lies in its versatility and adaptability, especially for teams needing features like meeting notes and project timelines.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBuild living, highly collaborative documents with Zoom Canvas\u0027s block-based, drag-and-drop editing, or design within the boundaries of a quintessential document in Zoom Paper \u0026mdash; with margins, headers and footers, pagination, and so on. No matter which solution you\u0027re using, you\u0027re getting powerful AI assistance, real-time collaboration, and the ability to templatize your documents to help you and your team save time and be more productive.\u003C/p\u003E"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there an additional cost for Zoom Canvas?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "\u003Cp\u003EZoom Canvas is included with your paid Zoom Workplace license. If you do not have a Zoom Workplace license, you can purchase it to get the most out of our Zoom AI Productivity Suite.\u003C/p\u003E"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I get Zoom Canvas \u00E0 la carte?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "\u003Cp\u003EZoom Canvas is available as part of our Zoom Workplace bundles or Zoom AI Productivity Suite.\u003C/p\u003E"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is AI Companion included with Zoom Canvas, or does it cost extra?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "\u003Cp\u003EAI Companion is baked into every tool in Zoom\u0027s AI Productivity Suite, including Canvas. Each AI Productivity Suite license includes AI credits that power intelligent features; however, we\u0026rsquo;re currently offering unlimited credits until May 30th to help teams experience the full capabilities of the suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFeatures and capabilities are subject to applicable usage limits, availability, and AI credit balances. Certain functions may require additional subscriptions or credits. Actual performance may vary depending on prompt, system conditions, and available data.\u003C/p\u003E"
      }
    }
  ]
